1
00:01:33,998 --> 00:01:35,999
"KATSUSHIKA POLICE HEADQUARTERS"

2
00:01:42,573 --> 00:01:43,341
Ohara-kun!

3
00:01:43,574 --> 00:01:44,308
Y-Yes, sir.

4
00:01:44,509 --> 00:01:48,579
You saw the video! What kind of training do you give to your subordinates?

5
00:01:48,779 --> 00:01:51,315
In a precinct-wide survey,

6
00:01:51,516 --> 00:01:55,953
Kameari Park was voted the station that officers least want to be assigned to.

7
00:01:56,154 --> 00:01:59,924
R-Ryotsu's to blame! It's all that idiot's fault!

8
00:02:00,124 --> 00:02:02,693
Because of him, our station is...

9
00:02:07,465 --> 00:02:08,599
I understand how you feel.

10
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:12,537
But if you don't get Ryotsu under control. it'll affect your career.

11
00:02:12,770 --> 00:02:16,541
No, no, if this goes on, even my job might be in danger.

12
00:02:16,774 --> 00:02:19,076
Please do something, Ohara-kun!

13
00:02:27,084 --> 00:02:30,021
All right, what should I play with today?

14
00:02:30,555 --> 00:02:31,389
Ryo-san!

15
00:02:31,622 --> 00:02:33,157
Today is &lt;i&gt;Dragon Tur&lt;/i&gt;....

16
00:02:34,892 --> 00:02:35,893
Nobody's here.

17
00:02:36,093 --> 00:02:37,195
Come on! Damn it!

18
00:02:37,862 --> 00:02:40,665
Bases are loaded, focus and throw with all you've got!

19
00:02:41,566 --> 00:02:44,669
Bah! And I had them cornered with two outs!

20
00:02:45,636 --> 00:02:46,737
I knew it.

21
00:02:46,971 --> 00:02:49,674
No wonder he couldn't hear us calling him.

22
00:02:50,208 --> 00:02:51,442
Junpei and Kappei.

23
00:02:51,676 --> 00:02:55,046
Just watch. If I shut them down this inning, victory is mine.

24
00:02:55,746 --> 00:02:57,748
Um, excuse me.

25
00:02:58,349 --> 00:03:00,384
There's someone at the entrance.

26
00:03:00,585 --> 00:03:02,186
Come on in! We're over here!

27
00:03:02,553 --> 00:03:03,688
O-Okay.

28
00:03:04,422 --> 00:03:08,392
Officer, I lost control of my car and crashed into a guardrail.

29
00:03:12,897 --> 00:03:17,101
You idiot! You distracted me, and now they've tied the game!

30
00:03:18,035 --> 00:03:19,303
But, I just said...

31
00:03:19,770 --> 00:03:23,541
I'm on my break right now! If you want something, come back later!

32
00:03:24,008 --> 00:03:25,209
S-Sorry!

33
00:03:28,012 --> 00:03:31,315
Time for the relief pitcher. I won't let them score another run!

34
00:03:31,549 --> 00:03:33,384
-Excuse me. -Another one.

35
00:03:33,584 --> 00:03:34,318
Come on in!

36
00:03:34,552 --> 00:03:35,620
Y-Yes...

37
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:39,423
Which way is Kameari Public Hall?

38
00:03:44,228 --> 00:03:46,097
W-Walk-off loss!

39
00:03:46,297 --> 00:03:47,231
How lame!

40
00:03:47,431 --> 00:03:48,799
Let's go home.

41
00:03:49,033 --> 00:03:51,102
Um, which way is Kameari...

42
00:03:54,338 --> 00:03:55,973
Public Hall...?

43
00:03:58,242 --> 00:04:00,111
It's your fault I lost the game!

44
00:04:00,311 --> 00:04:02,346
H-H-Help!

45
00:04:04,916 --> 00:04:07,151
Oops, it's about time.

46
00:04:10,955 --> 00:04:13,057
&lt;i&gt;Let's start with the first race.&lt;/i&gt;

47
00:04:13,257 --> 00:04:16,160
&lt;i&gt;-Here are the horses.&lt;/i&gt; -Um, starting with the first race...

48
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:18,262
You're really putting in the effort.

49
00:04:18,462 --> 00:04:22,433
Of course. I think of this as my real job.

50
00:04:22,633 --> 00:04:23,834
I see...

51
00:04:24,068 --> 00:04:25,970
Th-That voice...

52
00:04:30,374 --> 00:04:31,309
Chief!

53
00:04:31,509 --> 00:04:33,744
Um, isn't it a beautiful day?

54
00:04:34,645 --> 00:04:36,013
Ryotsu, come with me.

55
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,783
Oww! Ouch!

56
00:04:39,350 --> 00:04:42,153
That's strange. The chief didn't yell.

57
00:04:42,353 --> 00:04:45,022
He's beyond his usual level of anger.

58
00:04:45,222 --> 00:04:46,524
Look at this.

59
00:04:50,328 --> 00:04:53,698
It's security camera footage from the convenience store near the station.

60
00:04:55,032 --> 00:04:55,666
Ack!

61
00:04:56,133 --> 00:04:57,201
It's Ryotsu.

62
00:04:58,569 --> 00:05:00,104
What's he doing?

63
00:05:00,671 --> 00:05:04,175
No way! He's just peeling off the giveaway stickers!

64
00:05:04,375 --> 00:05:05,409
That's not all.

65
00:05:06,177 --> 00:05:07,945
Now he's in the ice cream section.

66
00:05:08,145 --> 00:05:09,547
What's he doing?

67
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:13,184
Oh! He's pulling out the ice cream sticks to look for winners!

68
00:05:13,384 --> 00:05:14,685
There's more.

69
00:05:14,885 --> 00:05:16,387
Now he's buying bread.

70
00:05:16,587 --> 00:05:18,689
What's he checking?

71
00:05:20,024 --> 00:05:22,426
Got it. He's comparing the expiration dates.

72
00:05:22,660 --> 00:05:25,696
But he usually doesn't mind eating rotten food!

73
00:05:27,732 --> 00:05:31,402
Oh, he's trying to get the one with the latest date from the back!

74
00:05:32,870 --> 00:05:33,904
Oh no!

75
00:05:34,572 --> 00:05:36,907
Ryo-chan caused a panic!

76
00:05:38,876 --> 00:05:39,844
Well, um...

77
00:05:40,044 --> 00:05:41,045
Well nothing!

78
00:05:41,245 --> 00:05:43,280
We got a complaint from the store.

79
00:05:43,514 --> 00:05:46,417
Your selfish behavior is causing serious trouble!

80
00:05:46,617 --> 00:05:47,818
No wonder.

81
00:05:48,018 --> 00:05:49,086
That's not all.

82
00:05:49,286 --> 00:05:52,523
You're also on the security cameras of the pachinko parlor,

83
00:05:52,723 --> 00:05:56,093
the game arcade, and even the dirty video store!

84
00:05:56,527 --> 00:05:59,597
But Chief, those were all outside of work hours!

85
00:05:59,997 --> 00:06:01,198
Liar!

86
00:06:01,399 --> 00:06:05,603
Starting today, I'll be with you 24 hours, checking your every move!

87
00:06:05,836 --> 00:06:07,838
-Got that, Ryotsu? -Ack...

88
00:06:13,711 --> 00:06:15,579
Bah, this is so annoying.

89
00:06:17,114 --> 00:06:18,015
Oh, Ryo-san!

90
00:06:18,482 --> 00:06:22,386
Your tip for the Akimoto Memorial race the other day was bang on!

91
00:06:22,586 --> 00:06:23,487
Y-You idiot!

92
00:06:23,721 --> 00:06:27,024
I'm currently patrolling the track... uh, I mean the streets!

93
00:06:27,925 --> 00:06:30,027
He must be confused.

94
00:06:30,394 --> 00:06:31,262
Hey, Ryo-san!

95
00:06:31,929 --> 00:06:35,733
The barbeque party in the park the other day was fun. Let's do it again!

96
00:06:35,933 --> 00:06:38,269
W-Wrong person! That wasn't me.

97
00:06:38,469 --> 00:06:40,071
What are you talking about?

98
00:06:40,271 --> 00:06:42,773
Look, I got my friends together and...

99
00:06:44,642 --> 00:06:47,445
So it was you who started that fire in the park.

100
00:06:47,645 --> 00:06:49,113
No, no!

101
00:06:49,313 --> 00:06:51,415
It wasn't me. I swear!

102
00:06:58,422 --> 00:07:01,759
"DRAGON TURTLE VII ON SALE FROM 3 P.M. TODAY!"

103
00:07:04,161 --> 00:07:07,965
&lt;i&gt;Oh, that's right. Dragon Turtle VII comes out today.&lt;/i&gt;

104
00:07:09,233 --> 00:07:11,001
I almost forgot...

105
00:07:12,436 --> 00:07:13,471
What's with that face?

106
00:07:14,105 --> 00:07:16,273
Oh, it's nothing.

107
00:07:16,474 --> 00:07:18,275
Cut it out! You look creepy!

108
00:07:18,843 --> 00:07:20,611
That's 680 yen.

109
00:07:25,015 --> 00:07:27,785
This is a problem. Ryotsu, dig it out right away!

110
00:07:27,985 --> 00:07:28,619
What?

111
00:07:28,986 --> 00:07:29,787
Find it!

112
00:07:29,987 --> 00:07:31,288
Y-Yes, sir!

113
00:07:37,161 --> 00:07:38,195
I'm sorry.

114
00:07:38,829 --> 00:07:42,933
&lt;i&gt;While I'm doing this, Dragon Turtle will sell out.&lt;/i&gt;

115
00:07:48,706 --> 00:07:51,408
&lt;i&gt;Dragon Turtle, Dragon Turtle...&lt;/i&gt;

116
00:07:57,181 --> 00:07:59,216
Why are you in such a hurry?

117
00:07:59,416 --> 00:08:01,418
Uh, no reason.

118
00:08:02,553 --> 00:08:05,156
&lt;i&gt;Dragon Turtle is gonna sell out!&lt;/i&gt;

119
00:08:05,356 --> 00:08:07,391
&lt;i&gt;Ugh, this is bad for my health.&lt;/i&gt;

120
00:08:07,591 --> 00:08:09,426
&lt;i&gt;I don't care what happens next!&lt;/i&gt;

121
00:08:11,295 --> 00:08:12,997
Hey! Stop, Ryotsu!

122
00:08:13,197 --> 00:08:14,665
I won't let you get away!

123
00:08:19,236 --> 00:08:20,905
&lt;i&gt;Dragon Turtle! Dragon Turtle!&lt;/i&gt;

124
00:08:21,705 --> 00:08:23,307
Ryotsu!

125
00:08:23,908 --> 00:08:25,910
Stop right there!

126
00:08:32,850 --> 00:08:35,052
Darn it, where did he go?

127
00:08:48,165 --> 00:08:50,434
Ryotsu! You can't escape from me!

128
00:08:50,901 --> 00:08:54,939
Argh! Let me go, Chief! &lt;i&gt;Dragon Turtle&lt;/i&gt; will sell out!

129
00:08:56,006 --> 00:08:57,441
Is that why you brought him back?

130
00:08:57,942 --> 00:09:02,947
It's classic Ryo-chan to try to run away to buy a new video game on release.

131
00:09:03,447 --> 00:09:07,218
Unless I put a rope around his neck and take him around like a dog,

132
00:09:07,418 --> 00:09:09,453
I'll never be able to control this guy.

133
00:09:09,653 --> 00:09:11,121
With all due respect, Chief,

134
00:09:11,355 --> 00:09:16,427
it's impossible to control another person's actions day and night!

135
00:09:16,627 --> 00:09:20,364
What did you say? Who do you think is causing me so much trouble!

136
00:09:20,564 --> 00:09:22,366
If you're so worried about my actions,

137
00:09:22,566 --> 00:09:25,269
why don't you make a jail cell and lock me up?

138
00:09:25,469 --> 00:09:26,370
You said it!

139
00:09:26,570 --> 00:09:29,940
All right. I'll build you a nice jail cell!

140
00:09:30,374 --> 00:09:31,208
What?

141
00:09:36,580 --> 00:09:38,983
This is your workplace and your home!

142
00:09:39,216 --> 00:09:40,284
N-No way!

143
00:09:40,484 --> 00:09:42,319
I have permission from the superintendent.

144
00:09:42,519 --> 00:09:46,290
You, the walking tabloid scandal, will work inside this cell from today!

145
00:09:46,490 --> 00:09:48,659
Let me out! I don't want to be in here!

146
00:09:48,859 --> 00:09:52,463
There're no games, no model kits, no TV!

147
00:09:52,663 --> 00:09:54,798
It won't break just by you shaking it.

148
00:09:54,999 --> 00:09:58,802
Damn it, you'll pay for this! I'm gonna break out of here!

149
00:10:23,827 --> 00:10:24,795
Just watch me.

150
00:10:36,206 --> 00:10:37,207
How do you like that?

151
00:10:41,912 --> 00:10:44,982
Something's wrong. It suddenly got heavy.

152
00:10:50,554 --> 00:10:53,123
That's quite a catch you've got there.

153
00:10:55,826 --> 00:10:58,729
Stop resisting, Ryotsu.

154
00:11:00,764 --> 00:11:02,700
Where did you get this?

155
00:11:02,900 --> 00:11:04,768
I'll keep it for you.

156
00:11:06,337 --> 00:11:08,505
This is just the beginning!

157
00:11:08,706 --> 00:11:11,041
I'll break out for sure!

158
00:11:34,965 --> 00:11:36,900
This is no joke.

159
00:11:37,101 --> 00:11:39,169
No TV, radio, or comic books.

160
00:11:39,370 --> 00:11:40,971
Sorting documents during the day,

161
00:11:41,205 --> 00:11:44,041
and handwriting sutras for mental training at night!

162
00:11:44,241 --> 00:11:46,243
I can't keep this up.

163
00:11:46,777 --> 00:11:50,114
The pillars are made of the hardest oak wood.

164
00:11:50,347 --> 00:11:52,750
It'd take a year to bite through them with my teeth.

165
00:11:53,517 --> 00:11:56,887
I'll need to get hold of some tools to break out of here.

166
00:12:02,192 --> 00:12:04,995
Hey, it's the tofu maker's kids.

167
00:12:10,768 --> 00:12:12,069
Let's see...

168
00:12:12,269 --> 00:12:15,005
I'll need this and that...

169
00:12:21,211 --> 00:12:23,480
"JUNPEI, KAPPEI IF YOU FIND THIS, OPEN AND READ IT".

170
00:12:24,581 --> 00:12:25,682
Fly true!

171
00:12:29,953 --> 00:12:31,321
Damn it!

172
00:12:38,962 --> 00:12:39,963
Yes!

173
00:12:44,301 --> 00:12:46,170
That stupid dog!

174
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:51,241
This time for sure!

175
00:12:52,042 --> 00:12:52,843
All right!

176
00:12:57,614 --> 00:12:59,116
What's this?

177
00:13:00,584 --> 00:13:03,487
"Right now, I am..."

178
00:13:17,301 --> 00:13:18,902
-Here you are. -Oh, thank you.

179
00:13:19,136 --> 00:13:21,438
-It was hard to get all this. -I know.

180
00:13:21,638 --> 00:13:23,440
Where's the video game you promised?

181
00:13:23,640 --> 00:13:25,042
Just a second.

182
00:13:25,275 --> 00:13:26,543
-Here it is. -Yay!

183
00:13:26,743 --> 00:13:28,445
Did you play &lt;i&gt;Dragon Turtle &lt;/i&gt;already?

184
00:13:28,645 --> 00:13:29,680
Of course!

185
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:30,647
That's great!

186
00:13:30,848 --> 00:13:34,017
If you get out, come to my place. I'll let you play it.

187
00:13:34,218 --> 00:13:35,452
-Really? -Yeah.

188
00:13:35,652 --> 00:13:38,455
All right, wait for me! I'll be there!

189
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:46,363
I wonder if Ryotsu has reflected on his actions a little.

190
00:13:46,864 --> 00:13:50,367
Well, I'm not sure. He seems to be staying quiet.

191
00:14:04,548 --> 00:14:08,685
&lt;i&gt;I'll cut the power to the police station and slip out in the chaos!&lt;/i&gt;

192
00:14:12,422 --> 00:14:13,257
Oh!

193
00:14:13,891 --> 00:14:15,259
What, a blackout?

194
00:14:16,493 --> 00:14:19,263
Uh, I think there's a candle somewhere in here.

195
00:14:19,496 --> 00:14:20,931
Now's my chance.

196
00:14:25,035 --> 00:14:26,069
&lt;i&gt;Oh no!&lt;/i&gt;

197
00:14:28,272 --> 00:14:30,107
Chief, what happened?

198
00:14:32,910 --> 00:14:33,777
No way!

199
00:14:34,578 --> 00:14:35,279
Ryotsu!

200
00:14:37,614 --> 00:14:38,448
He's here.

201
00:14:38,682 --> 00:14:41,084
I'm sorry, Chief. I regret what I did.

202
00:14:41,285 --> 00:14:42,786
As you should.

203
00:14:42,986 --> 00:14:48,792
Ryotsu, sitting there makes you realize just how foolish you've been, doesn't it?

204
00:14:48,992 --> 00:14:50,961
I'm sorry, Chief. I regret what I did.

205
00:14:51,161 --> 00:14:53,830
That's good. Keep working hard.

206
00:14:54,231 --> 00:14:57,534
Looks like even Ryotsu got the message this time.

207
00:14:57,734 --> 00:15:00,637
He just keeps repeating "I'm sorry" like a broken record...

208
00:15:01,305 --> 00:15:02,940
Wait, he's not that kind of guy!

209
00:15:03,740 --> 00:15:05,175
Terai, give me the key!

210
00:15:05,409 --> 00:15:06,710
O-Okay.

211
00:15:09,646 --> 00:15:10,948
Hey, Ryotsu!

212
00:15:11,148 --> 00:15:13,116
What are you up to?

213
00:15:13,917 --> 00:15:20,490
I'm sorry, Chief. I regret what I did.

214
00:15:21,191 --> 00:15:25,495
Sorry, sorry, Chief, Chief. I regret what I did. Sorry...

215
00:15:25,729 --> 00:15:29,299
-This is... -I'm sorry, Chief. I regret what I did.

216
00:15:29,833 --> 00:15:31,268
Nice work, Ryo-chan.

217
00:15:31,568 --> 00:15:33,937
That crafty little...

218
00:15:36,573 --> 00:15:38,408
So that &lt;i&gt;was&lt;/i&gt; him just now!

219
00:15:39,743 --> 00:15:40,410
Ryotsu!

220
00:15:40,611 --> 00:15:41,511
Uh-oh!

221
00:15:42,446 --> 00:15:43,747
I won't let you get away!

222
00:15:45,215 --> 00:15:46,350
Are you there?

223
00:15:47,284 --> 00:15:48,118
Take this!

224
00:15:50,287 --> 00:15:52,456
Ouch...

225
00:15:54,858 --> 00:15:56,193
How do you like that!

226
00:15:56,426 --> 00:15:59,196
Damn it. I was so close!

227
00:16:07,638 --> 00:16:08,972
What do you think, Ryotsu?

228
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:14,678
This barbed wire goes all the way up into the ceiling too, like an insect cage.

229
00:16:15,479 --> 00:16:16,680
And what's more...

230
00:16:21,151 --> 00:16:25,155
As you can see, there's a high-voltage current running through it.

231
00:16:27,057 --> 00:16:28,825
How about that, Ryotsu?

232
00:16:29,860 --> 00:16:31,728
&lt;i&gt;I can't believe he's gone this far.&lt;/i&gt;

233
00:16:31,928 --> 00:16:34,331
&lt;i&gt;It's time for the last resort!&lt;/i&gt;

234
00:16:38,068 --> 00:16:39,669
How's Ryotsu doing?

235
00:16:40,370 --> 00:16:42,406
He seems to be quietly writing sutras.

236
00:16:42,639 --> 00:16:45,342
Good. There's no chance of escape this time.

237
00:16:45,542 --> 00:16:47,477
But stay alert!

238
00:16:51,081 --> 00:16:52,182
Hmm...

239
00:16:53,550 --> 00:16:57,821
Tunnel Harry should be outside the station by now.

240
00:17:19,910 --> 00:17:21,712
Did you hear something?

241
00:17:21,912 --> 00:17:23,146
Something?

242
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:25,148
Yeah. Maybe it was my imagination.

243
00:17:27,050 --> 00:17:28,885
That's strange. I could've sworn...

244
00:17:29,086 --> 00:17:31,288
&lt;i&gt;Uh-oh! I'm still inside the station!&lt;/i&gt;

245
00:17:32,422 --> 00:17:35,425
Hmm? What's with this floor tile? It's raised.

246
00:17:37,060 --> 00:17:38,862
Stop it! Don't stamp on it!

247
00:17:42,566 --> 00:17:44,868
Stop jumping! Get off it!

248
00:17:47,938 --> 00:17:50,807
Hey, stop that! It tickles!

249
00:17:51,575 --> 00:17:52,476
Huh?

250
00:17:53,076 --> 00:17:55,011
I think I heard something again...

251
00:18:02,586 --> 00:18:04,354
Argh! A cave-in!

252
00:18:06,189 --> 00:18:07,124
What was that?

253
00:18:07,324 --> 00:18:08,492
No idea.

254
00:18:09,259 --> 00:18:10,327
Could it be Ryotsu?

255
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:11,828
This is bad!

256
00:18:12,462 --> 00:18:14,331
Ryotsu, are you doing something?

257
00:18:14,564 --> 00:18:20,337
&lt;i&gt;Namu Myoho Renge Kyo, Hannya Hara Miya Ho...&lt;/i&gt;

258
00:18:21,571 --> 00:18:23,907
Writing sutras really cleanses the soul.

259
00:18:24,107 --> 00:18:25,342
What's with that outfit?

260
00:18:25,575 --> 00:18:28,812
Well, I got so into it that I got too hot.

261
00:18:29,513 --> 00:18:30,514
And that helmet?

262
00:18:30,747 --> 00:18:34,584
Oh, I thought it'd help stop me straining my eyes.

263
00:18:34,785 --> 00:18:35,619
And the rope?

264
00:18:35,819 --> 00:18:37,621
This is fashion, Chief.

265
00:18:37,821 --> 00:18:40,957
Ropes are popular these days, didn't you know?

266
00:18:43,827 --> 00:18:48,932
Tunnel Harry is beyond repair.

267
00:18:49,132 --> 00:18:51,935
I'd better switch to Tunnel Tom.

268
00:18:52,369 --> 00:18:55,872
Right. I'm gonna dig all night long!

269
00:19:07,417 --> 00:19:08,485
Oh, it's empty.

270
00:19:08,685 --> 00:19:10,387
I'll fill it up.

271
00:19:11,021 --> 00:19:12,789
No, it's okay.

272
00:19:16,660 --> 00:19:18,628
Whoa! I hit the water pipe!

273
00:19:24,868 --> 00:19:26,036
Huh?

274
00:19:26,236 --> 00:19:28,338
Crap! Come on, stop!

275
00:19:30,173 --> 00:19:30,907
That's odd...

276
00:19:32,642 --> 00:19:34,010
What the hell?

277
00:19:35,078 --> 00:19:36,179
Ryotsu?

278
00:19:36,379 --> 00:19:37,681
Th-This is bad!

279
00:19:37,881 --> 00:19:38,715
Ryotsu!

280
00:19:38,915 --> 00:19:44,354
&lt;i&gt;Namu Myoho Renge Kyo, Hannya Hora Mata Ho...&lt;/i&gt;

281
00:19:44,888 --> 00:19:46,990
&lt;i&gt;With a mind free of all thought...&lt;/i&gt;

282
00:19:51,127 --> 00:19:52,562
That should do it.

283
00:19:53,129 --> 00:19:56,566
But I can't keep going straight.

284
00:19:58,401 --> 00:20:00,070
Okay, this way.

285
00:20:10,280 --> 00:20:11,281
What?

286
00:20:11,481 --> 00:20:13,717
This way is the sewer pipe.

287
00:20:14,050 --> 00:20:16,119
In that case, this way!

288
00:21:03,833 --> 00:21:06,536
I did it! I made it out!

289
00:21:06,770 --> 00:21:08,104
I'm free!

290
00:21:10,974 --> 00:21:14,377
Watch out. I'm gonna get my revenge!

291
00:21:14,611 --> 00:21:16,780
Ryotsu's escaped?!

292
00:21:20,817 --> 00:21:22,352
Is he a mole?

293
00:21:22,852 --> 00:21:25,855
-Find him now, hurry! -Yes, sir!

294
00:21:38,501 --> 00:21:39,836
We can't get out like this!

295
00:21:40,036 --> 00:21:41,871
This is Ryotsu's doing!

296
00:21:43,773 --> 00:21:44,874
That's right!

297
00:21:45,375 --> 00:21:47,377
Ryotsu! You scoundrel!

298
00:21:51,181 --> 00:21:54,851
In my right hand, 100 cockroaches!

299
00:21:56,119 --> 00:21:59,723
In my left hand, 100 bees!

300
00:22:00,690 --> 00:22:03,126
Now, which one do you want me to put in?

301
00:22:03,326 --> 00:22:05,695
Where did you get those?

302
00:22:05,895 --> 00:22:07,731
Stop this nonsense right now!

303
00:22:07,964 --> 00:22:10,700
Oh, really? You want both?

304
00:22:10,900 --> 00:22:12,001
Here you go!

305
00:22:20,744 --> 00:22:23,546
Plus, here's some smoke bombs and firecrackers as a bonus!

306
00:22:33,556 --> 00:22:36,993
How's that? This is what happens when you make me your enemy!

307
00:22:38,862 --> 00:22:39,696
Oh no!

308
00:22:40,063 --> 00:22:41,231
Got you, Ryotsu!

309
00:22:41,431 --> 00:22:44,701
Ouch, ouch, ouch! Barbed wire on my back!

310
00:22:50,173 --> 00:22:52,642
I wonder if Ohara-kun is handling things well.

311
00:22:52,876 --> 00:22:55,412
Ouch, ouch, ouch! It hurts, it hurts!

312
00:22:55,612 --> 00:22:57,914
Hey! Stop stinging me, bees!

313
00:22:58,114 --> 00:23:00,183
Oww! Oww!

314
00:23:00,650 --> 00:23:04,120
Chief, help me! It was just a joke! Ouch!

315
00:23:04,320 --> 00:23:06,122
You were serious!

316
00:23:06,322 --> 00:23:09,426
Thanks to the tunnel he made, we escaped safely.

317
00:23:09,626 --> 00:23:10,427
We sure did.

318
00:23:10,627 --> 00:23:13,029
Damn you! I dug it all by myself!

319
00:23:13,229 --> 00:23:15,131
That's not fair, you jerks! Ouch!

320
00:23:19,402 --> 00:23:21,971
Ohara-kun, what the heck is this?

321
00:23:22,572 --> 00:23:26,976
Superintendent! This is a fire drill, or rather...

322
00:23:37,353 --> 00:23:43,927
Help me, Chief! I won't do it again! Please!

323
00:23:44,461 --> 00:23:45,361
Ohara-kun.

324
00:23:45,595 --> 00:23:46,596
Yes, sir.

325
00:23:46,796 --> 00:23:49,899
Let's just pretend this police station never existed.

326
00:23:50,967 --> 00:23:54,804
Hey! I'm still alive down here!

327
00:23:55,004 --> 00:23:59,642
SOS! SOS! Chief!
